    "body": "﻿Review fix pushed. New head: 72c8f293d. The PR stays a draft.\n\nRed on the old head 0761173e8 (quick gate of stacked PR #1954):\n- `setup_align::unverified_kinds_are_refused_while_verified_picks_generate_aligned`\n- `stitch_cross::a_self_touching_single_body_still_stops_at_its_top_level`\n\n`setup_align`, case (a): the refusal is correct. The picked face is the modelled top annulus. After the flip over Y, Z 10..20 of the part is solid. The cutter centre Outside of the hole ring is at +-8 mm, in that solid at Z 16 and Z 12. The law reads the setup frame. The test now picks the modelled bottom face with Side Outside and asserts a cut below the top. The annulus stays as a control: it generates as modelled, and it is refused after the flip.\n\n`stitch_cross`, case (b): the refusal gave the wrong cause. Outside of this outline is air. The ladder stopped the ring because the self-touching shell cannot be sectioned (non-manifold, fail closed). The law told the user to set Side to Inside. The ladder now keeps the slice error for each ring. The law still refuses, but it names the mesh error and the skipped levels, not the side. The test pins this.\n\nQuick gate on 72c8f293d: 4 steps, 0 failed. Clippy on camcraft-motion and camcraft-app is clean. The PR body has the readings and the test counts.\r\n",
